in sub sub
make: Leaving directory '<DIR>/sub'
--- stderr

=== make -C sub --no-print-directory
--- status 0
--- stdout
in sub sub
--- stderr

=== make --directory=sub -s
--- status 0
--- stdout
in sub sub
--- stderr

=== make -C nonexistent; echo "status $?"
--- status 0
--- stdout
make: Entering directory '<DIR>'
make: Leaving directory '<DIR>'
status 2
--- stderr
make: *** nonexistent: No such file or directory.  Stop.

=== files
sub/
sub/Makefile: "all: ; @echo in sub $(notdir $(CURDIR))\n"
